{
  "title": "Namaz of Imam al-Sadiq (a.s.)",
  "data": "Upon concluding the prayer, say the following supplication:\nيَا صَانِعَ كُلِّ مَصْنُوْعٍ\nYAA SAANI'A KULLI MASNOO'\nO He Who Makes all made things!\nيَا جَابِرَ كُلِّ كَسِيْرٍ\nYAA JAABIRA KULLI KASEER\nO He Who splints all broken bones!\nوَيَا حَاضِرَ كُلِّ مَلَاءٍ\nWA YAA HAADIRA KULLI MALA'\nO He Who is present in all assemblages!\nوَيَا شَاهِدَ كُلِّ نَجْوٰى\nWA YAA SHAAHIDA KULLI NAJWAA\nO He Who is the Witness of all confidential talks!\nوَيَا عَالِمَ كُلِّ خَفِيَّةٍ\nWA YAA A'ALIMA KULLI KHAFIYYAH\nO He Who knows all hidden matters!\nوَيَا شَاهِداً غَيْرَ غَائِبٍ\nWA YAA SHAAHIDAN GHAYRA GHAA'IB\nO He Who is always present and is never absent!\nوَغَالِباً غَيْرَ مَغْلُوْبٍ\nWA GHAALIBAN GHAYRA MAGHLOOB\nO He Who is always triumphant and is never defeated!\nوَيَا قَرِيْباً غَيْرَ بَعِيْدٍ\nWA YAA QAREEBAN GHAYRA BA'EED\nO He Who is always nigh and is never remote!\nوَيَا مُؤْنِسَ كُلِّ وَحِيْدٍ\nWA YAA MU'NISA KULLI WAHEED\nO He Who entertains all lonely ones!\nوَيَا حَيُّ مُحْيِيَ الْمَوْتٰى\nWA YAA HAYYU MUHYIYAL MAWTAA\nO He Who is ever-living, raiser of the dead,\nوَمُمِيْتَ الْاَحْيَاءِ\nWA MUMEETAL AHYAA'\nand causing the alive to die!\nالْقَائِمُ عَلٰى كُلِّ نَفْسٍ بِمَا كَسَبَتْ\nAL-QAA'IMU A'LAA KULLI NAFSIN BIMAA KASABAT\nO He Who watches every soul as to what it earns!\nوَيَا حَيّاً حِيْنَ لَا حَيَّ\nWA YAA HAYYAN HEENA LAA HAYY\nO He Who was living when there was nothing existent!\nلَا اِلٰهَ اِلَّا اَنْتَ\nLAA ILAAHA ILLAA ANT\nThere is no god save You!\nصَلِّ عَلٰى مُحَمَّدٍ وَآلِ مُحَمَّدٍ\nSALLI A'LAA MUHAMMADIN WA AALI MUHAMMAD\n(please) send blessings to Muhammad and the Household of Muhammad.",
  "merits": "In his book of Jamal al-Usbu', Sayyid Ibn Tawus has recorded a special prayer and supplication for each of the Holy Imams (a.s.), to be offered on Fridays.\nImam al-Sadiq (a.s.)'s prayer consists of two units. In each unit, recite [Surah al-Fatihah](A5) once and Ayat al-Shahadah ([Surah Ali 'Imran](A7), 3:18-19) one hundred times."
}
